# Custom subagent definitions go in this directory.
#
# Each subagent is a single .md file with frontmatter:
#
#   ---
#   name: my-agent-name
#   description: When to use this agent (one sentence). Used by the orchestrator to choose.
#   tools: Read, Grep, Glob   # optional; subset of available tools
#   ---
#
#   System prompt body for the subagent goes here.
#
# See AGENTS.md (in the workspace root) for role definitions you can lift into
# subagent files when you want them to run in their own isolated context.
